<view class="page"><view class="page-title">管理看板</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载数据…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><picker wx:if="{{communities.length}}" range="{{communities}}" range-key="name" value="{{communityIndex}}" bindchange="chooseCommunity"><view class="picker">{{communities[communityIndex].name}}</view></picker><block wx:if="{{metrics}}"><view class="card"><view>订单 {{metrics.totalOrders}} · 付费 {{metrics.paidOrders}}</view><view>服务费流水 ¥{{metrics.turnoverYuan}} · 实际收入 ¥{{metrics.actualYuan}}</view><view>住户 {{metrics.residentCount}} · 15 分钟接单率 {{metrics.acceptRateText}}</view><view>平均接单 {{metrics.averageAcceptMinutes}} 分钟 · 未接单告警 {{metrics.unacceptedAlerts}}</view><view>投诉 {{metrics.complaintCount}} · 退款 ¥{{metrics.refundYuan}}</view><view>值班服务员 {{metrics.onDutyProviders}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">订单状态</view><view wx:for="{{metrics.statusRows}}" wx:key="status">{{item.label}}：{{item.count}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">有效月卡</view><view>垃圾月卡 {{metrics.memberships.trash || 0}} · 快递月卡 {{metrics.memberships.express || 0}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">来源漏斗</view><view>扫码 {{metrics.funnel.scans}} · 绑定 {{metrics.funnel.binds}} · 首单 {{metrics.funnel.firstPaid}} · 第二单 {{metrics.funnel.secondPaid}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">服务员</view><view wx:for="{{metrics.providerStats}}" wx:key="id">{{item.name}} · 完成 {{item.completed}} 单 · 评分 {{item.averageRating}}</view></view></block></view>
